			<title>New PS5 Firmware Update Available Now as Sony Cracks Down on Jailbreaks</title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p><strong>What does version 26.07-14.22.00 do?</strong></p><p>Sony has released another system software update for PS5, hot on the heels of <a href="https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/10/ps5-firmware-update-26-07-14-20-00-available-to-download-now">the last one</a> from less than a fortnight ago.</p><p>Version 26.07-14.22.00 is available to download and install now, and the singular patch note makes it fairly clear what it's targeting:</p><p>Read the <a href="https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/11/new-ps5-firmware-update-available-now-as-sony-cracks-down-on-jailbreaks">full article on pushsquare.com</a></p>]]></description>
