		<item>
			<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
			<title>Fortnite&#039;s Pirate Shop Unlocks the Entire Item Shop for Free</title>
			<description><![CDATA[<p><strong>Battle Royale tops five million concurrent players.</strong></p><p>In case you haven’t been paying attention, <a href="https://www.pushsquare.com/games/ps5/fortnite">Fortnite</a> is running a pirate-themed season with <em>One Piece</em> crossover content available right now.</p><p>But the big news is <a href="https://x.com/ShiinaBR/status/2116822592556580874">the discovery of a Pirate Shop</a>, which makes the entire Item Shop free for two weeks. If you’re running in a squad, then everyone on your team gets the reward.</p><p>Read the <a href="https://www.pushsquare.com/news/2026/11/fortnites-pirate-shop-unlocks-the-entire-item-shop-for-free">full article on pushsquare.com</a></p>]]></description>
